&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There is no place like home and home care is the future of healthcare.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you tired of running from patient to patient? Sick of working for a company that treats you like a number, not like a nurse? Are you ready to provide rewarding 1:1 care, achieve the work-life balance you deserve, and explore a career in home care?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now that you are ready to make a career move, you need to find a home care company that aligns with your high expectations and core values and &lt;strong&gt;BAYADA is the answer! We are not your typical home care company; we are the gold standard in home care. &lt;/strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care has been providing exceptional services for over 50 years and is nationally recognized for the respect and appreciation we show our field employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our local office is currently hiring nurses to work 1:1 with local pediatric and adult clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;We are hiring for full-time, part-time, and per diem opportunities in Middleburg and surrounding towns.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Offers Our Nurses:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling (no p/t-prn scheduling required)&lt;/li&gt;
